==English==

===Etymology===
From the past participle stem of {{der|en|la|nictitō}}, frequentative form of {{m|la|nictō|t=I wink}} (see {{cog|en|nictate}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈnɪktɪteɪtɪŋ/}}

